<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_824_2245.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründlich</unclear> willig diennst, unnd was wir
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrnn</unclear>, liebs unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guts</unclear> vermögen zuvor. Fürsichtig
<lb n="3"/>Ersamen unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weysen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Innfonnders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liebe</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gute</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frenndt</unclear>. Wir haben E. E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">w</unclear>. schreiben unns
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sachenn</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Anthoni</unclear> Stadlers</persName>, unnd seiner <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glöubig</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">halbenn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gethon</unclear>, empfanngen, auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alsbaldt</unclear>
<lb n="7"/>zu gemeltem <persName resp="#ner">Stadler</persName> wider umb verordnet, unnd
<lb n="8"/>Ime Innhalt der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glöubiger</unclear> schreibens, (abermals) <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">d</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gepuer</unclear> nach Inn allweg, wie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jüngstlich</unclear> Inn gegen-
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">württigkait</unclear> gemainer seiner <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glöubiger</unclear> verord-
<lb n="11"/>netten, unnd auch vor <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Irer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ankunfft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bescheh</unclear>,
<lb n="12"/>uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allerlaj</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mögliche</unclear> mittel unnd weg, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansprechen</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lassenn</unclear>. Der Ist nun uff dem allem, davon er
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erstlichs</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnsern</unclear> verordnetten, unnd auch voll-
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genndts</unclear> dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ausschuß</unclear> seiner <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glöubiger</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ir</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aigenntlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ingebildete</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eroffnete</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allen</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">umbstennden</unclear> selbs <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mündtliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anzaigung</unclear> gethon,
<lb n="18"/>mit seinem bericht noch Inn allweg <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beharlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bestenndig</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allso</unclear> das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainiche</unclear> transmutation <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">od</unclear> ab-
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wechslung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hievoriger</unclear> seiner <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anzaigungen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bej</unclear> Ime
<lb n="21"/>Inn dem wenigsten nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befinden</unclear>. Unnd wiewoll
<lb n="22"/>er <persName resp="#ner">Stadler</persName> unnd auch wir, uff alles das, so durch
<lb n="23"/>gedachten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußschuß</unclear>, Inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegenwürttigkait</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obangezogner</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnserer</unclear> verordnetten, nit annderst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darfür</unclear> ge-
<lb n="25"/>achtet, dann es <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">were</unclear> bey vermelts <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußschuß</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jüngstgenomnem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abschid</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verpliben</unclear>, Dieweil
<lb n="27"/>aber von demselb unnd was Inn allweg <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehanndelt</unclear>,
<lb n="28"/>Inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beeden</unclear> schreiben die wenigst anmeldung beschicht,
<lb n="29"/>so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hatt</unclear> mit gemeltem <persName resp="#ner">Stadler</persName> diser zeit, sonnderlich
<lb n="30"/>dieweil er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiezwischen</unclear> unnd erst <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heut</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kayserlichen</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hailig</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-559" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Römischen</unclear> Reichs</orgName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstrickung</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">by</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemelt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ervolgt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desselben</unclear> auch uff sein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erpiet</unclear>-
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_824_2246.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nichtzit</unclear> weiters <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuergenommen</unclear> werden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moegen</unclear>,
<lb n="34"/>wann nun obgemelten seinen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Creditoren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gloubigeren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ietzangeregter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abschid</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> sein er-
<lb n="36"/>pieten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heimbannemblich</unclear>, So <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear>
<lb n="37"/>wir denselben allen unnd ainem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ieden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">insonnder</unclear>-
<lb n="38"/>hait so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> bey unns uff recht <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">niderwerffen</unclear>
<lb n="39"/>lassen unnd zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spruch</unclear> unnd vorderung
<lb n="40"/>hat, ald zuhaben vermaint, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ge</unclear>-
<lb n="41"/>mainen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">peremptorischen</unclear> rechtstag, nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">form</unclear> und
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ordnung</unclear> rechtens angesetzt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ernennt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haben</unclear>
<lb n="43"/>namblich <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zinstags</unclear> nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bartholomei</unclear> den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zwoelfften</unclear>
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dis</unclear> scheinenden monats Augusti <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nechstkunfftig</unclear></date>
<lb n="45"/>vor unnserm <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stattamman</unclear> unnd obern statt-
<lb n="46"/>gericht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alhie</unclear> morgens zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sechß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uren</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">frieer</unclear> tag-
<lb n="47"/>zeit, uff unnserm <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rathhauß</unclear> zuerscheinen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Allsdann</unclear>
<lb n="48"/>soll unnd mag ain <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ieder</unclear> durch sich selbst od seinen
<lb n="49"/>zu recht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gevollmechtigten</unclear> anwaldt, sein action und
<lb n="50"/>vorderung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerpringen</unclear>, unnd das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihe</unclear>-
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nig</unclear>, was sich innhalt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gerichtlichen</unclear> ordnung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuthun</unclear> gepürt,
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hanndelen</unclear>, Das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolten</unclear> wir E. E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>.
<lb n="53"/>denen wir zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündtlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diennsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iederzeit</unclear> ge-
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">naigt</unclear>, zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begerter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wideranntwurt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pergen</unclear>,
<lb n="55"/>Dat den <origDate when="1556-08-04" cert="medium" resp="#ner">4. Augusti anno <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">d</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">56</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="56"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermaister und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rhat</unclear>
<lb n="57"/>der statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ueberlingen</unclear></orgName>.
